            source: 'Sky Sports', sourceUrl: 'https://www.skysports.com/football/news/12016/13560286/world-cup-2026-englands-last-16-tie-with-mexico-will-kick-off-at-1am-monday', sourceSnippet: '英格兰对墨西哥 — 天空体育'
